##|(markdown) text_1
# Recalls in a Year
This notebook reads `auto_recalls_filter.malloy`, whose model declares a required **Recall Year** given: pick one above before the tiles run. The optional filters (manufacturer, subject, major recalls, dates) are this notebook's own, declared below and bound on every tile.

### Top 5 Manufacturers — Recall Trends Over Time
|##

import './auto_recalls_filter.malloy'

# label="Manufacturer" control=multiselect suggest { source=recalls dimension=Manufacturer }
given: manufacturer_filter :: filter<string> is f''
# label="Subject"
given: subject_filter :: filter<string> is f''
# label="Major Recall"
given: major_recall_filter :: filter<boolean> is f''
# label="Recall Date"
given: recall_date_range :: filter<date> is f''

##|(markdown) text_2
### Recall Dashboard — Top 3 Manufacturers
|##

##|(markdown) text_3
### Most Recent Recalls
|##

##|(markdown) text_4
### Biggest Recalls of All Time (by vehicles affected)
|##

##|(markdown) text_5
### Recalls by Component
|##

##|(markdown) text_6
### Recalls Involving Brakes
|##

source: recalls_tiles is recalls extend {
  where:
    Manufacturer ~ $manufacturer_filter,
    Subject ~ $subject_filter,
    `Major Recall` ~ $major_recall_filter,
    recall_date ~ $recall_date_range

  view: tile_1 is by_year_manufacturer_line_chart

  view: tile_2 is recall_dashboard + {limit: 3}

  view: tile_3 is recent_recalls + {limit: 10}

  view: tile_4 is biggest_recalls + {limit: 10}

  view: tile_5 is by_component + {limit: 15}

  view: tile_6 is recall_dashboard + {
    where: `Recall Description` ~r'brake'
  }
}
